(1. Cell: Smallest basic unit of life \(e.g. Amoeba, Paramecium\).) Tj
T* (2. Tissue: Group of similar cells performing a specific function \(e.g. xylem, blood\).) Tj
T* (3. Organ: Group of tissues working together \(e.g. leaf, heart\).) Tj
T* (4. System: Group of organs functioning together \(e.g. digestive, circulatory system\).) Tj
T* (5. Organism: The complete living entity.) Tj
